# Normalize line endings so Windows checkouts don't reintroduce CRLF and
# create spurious "local changes" that block pulls/merges.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` means: treat files as text, and store AND check them out
# with LF everywhere (repo and working tree), regardless of the OS. Editors on
# Windows handle LF fine; this keeps JSON/JS/etc. byte-identical across machines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Be explicit for the source types in this repo.
*.js    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
*.css   text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.gitignore text eol=lf

# Binary assets (should never be line-ending converted). Listed ahead of time so
# adding cover art / sample PDFs later just works.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
